{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792785840, "covers_from": "2026-10-23T20:04:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-23T20:05:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792785900, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-23T20:04:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 14272, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "把樹種回來，城市綠化，樹多才會涼爽！還我大樹。", "display_name": "中正代表 No.14,272", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T20:04:08+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 5282, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "隨便路上都有人在抽菸，走在路上都沒辦法好好呼吸。", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.5,282", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T20:04:16+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 21124, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "好多老鼠又一直砍樹，還頻頻出現食安問題，要不是演唱會沒高雄場，我一步都不會踏進台北！", "display_name": "信義代表 No.21,124", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T20:04:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50210, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "文化", "content": "韓國城市級辦的獨立遊戲展令人驚艷。台灣獨立遊戲團隊表現非常亮眼，請給予支持創作和發展的政策。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.50,210", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T20:04:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 12586, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "信義跟基隆路口人行道跟柏油路的高度斷差讓我十年前摔過一次都過了十年還是一樣爛，現在這騎車的外國人超多", "display_name": "信義代表 小藍", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 5282, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.5,282", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 21124, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.21,124", "district": "xinyi", "is_rep